{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Macross","In 1999, a giant alien spacecraft crash lands on South Ataria island. Humanity proceeds to attempt to rebuild this marvel, but political conflicts centered around the Macross result in a global war. After 10 years, the Unification Wars are finally over, the new Earth United Nations Government is in power, and work on the Macross is complete.\n\n\n\nOn the day of the launching ceremony, its main cannon fires on its own, destroying an alien spacecraft. This fateful day marks the beginning of the war between the humans on the Macross and the Zentradi, a race of humanoid aliens of giant proportions.\n\n\n\n(Source: AnimEigo)"],"ja":["超時空要塞マクロス",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":194,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":474,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-1088","ids":{"shikimori":1088,"mal":1088,"anilist":1088,"kodik":"serial-21254"},"kodikIds":["serial-5592","serial-21260","serial-50561","serial-21254"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-5592":"2019-12-22T13:13:27Z","serial-21260":"2020-01-14T23:30:34Z","serial-50561":"2024-11-15T07:37:37Z","serial-21254":"2021-02-12T18:26:57Z"},"title":"Макросс","originalTitle":"Choujikuu Yousai Macross","alt":"The Super Dimension Fortress Macross","description":"В 1999 году корабль пришельцев терпит крушение на острове Южной Аталии — теперь человечество знает об иной жизни за пределами Земли. Десять лет спустя тот самый корабль перестроили и окрестили его SDF-1 Macross. Однако в день его первого полёта раса пришельцев, зовущихся зентреди, появляется на Земле, тем самым положив начало войне, которой суждено изменить историю обеих рас навсегда.","year":1982,"type":"TV","genres":["Романтика","Фантастика","меха","военное","Музыка","космос"],"rating":7.89,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[194,474],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1088/bacbda63f0fb2fa2850cb93645ba32f8.jpeg","width":435,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/fi